  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Combating climate change through avoiding deforestation and land tenure Q`eqchi`s indigenous communities in Guatemala.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sa Qa Chol Nimla K&apos;aleb&apos;aal (SANK) will work in 100 communities in the municipalities of Chisec and Raxuh in Alta Verapaz to conform the possession and ownership of land to Q&apos;eqchi&apos;tradition; to raise awareness of environmental degradation; and to train farmers in the advantages of crop diversification and the risks associated with monocroping and the overuse of pesticides.</narrative>
  </description>
